{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45614","headline":"题弘顗三藏院 · 贯休","name":"题弘顗三藏院","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仪清态淡雕琼瓌，卷帘潇洒无尘埃。\n岳茶如乳庭花开，信心弟子时时来。\n灌顶坛严伸㽬塞，三十年功苦拘束。\n梵僧梦里授微言，雪岭白牛力深得。\n水精一索香一炉，红莲花舌生醍醐。\n初听喉音宝楼阁，如闻魔王宫殿拉金瓦落。\n次听妙音大随求，更觉人间万事深悠悠。\n四音俱作清且柔，爱河浊浪却倒流。\n却倒流兮无处去，碧海含空日初曙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45614.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45614","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}